（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(21年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"90.2\" width=\"320\" height=\"7.0\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,22.1 9.1,22.1 14.2,29.2 19.3,17.5 24.5,19.8 29.6,17.5 34.7,19.8 39.8,24.5 44.9,24.5 50.0,26.8 55.1,57.3 60.3,78.5 65.4,78.5 70.5,83.2 75.6,87.9 80.7,85.5 85.8,85.5 91.0,80.8 96.1,73.8 101.2,71.4 106.3,76.1 111.4,78.5 116.5,73.8 121.6,71.4 126.8,66.7 131.9,66.7 137.0,12.8 142.1,40.9 147.2,45.6 152.3,52.7 157.4,57.3 162.6,57.3 167.7,57.3 172.8,62.0 177.9,59.7 183.0,59.7 188.1,76.1 193.2,69.1 198.4,66.7 203.5,85.5 208.6,83.2 213.7,78.5 218.8,90.2 223.9,94.9 229.0,90.2 234.2,90.2 239.3,94.9 244.4,85.5 249.5,83.2 254.6,80.8 259.7,69.1 264.9,85.5 270.0,83.2 275.1,76.1 280.2,80.8 285.3,87.9 290.4,87.9 295.5,85.5 300.7,85.5 305.8,90.2 310.9,90.2 316.0,92.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 34.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 34.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 80.7 97.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 203.5 97.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 223.9 106.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 264.9 97.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 290.4 99.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" 